      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "Metagenomics pipeline: classifies taxa with Kraken2/Bracken and MetaPhlAn, profiles functions with HUMAnN, and renders Krona taxonomy.\n\nData source: Zenodo record 17661262 (Galaxy Training Network).\nreads_forward.fastq (3.0M), reads_reverse.fastq (3.0M).\nCoffee fermentation metagenome subset for assembly tutorial.\nURL: https://zenodo.org/records/17661262\nAll database, taxonomy, and HUMAnN single-file inputs are explicit placeholders and must be staged before execution."
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "Notes",
        "color": "#f59e0b"
      }
    },
